  "intro": [
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Dazed and shaking, I stagger along the gloomy passages. The emergency shuttle"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "should be - must be - in this area. I round one final corner and there, glinting"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "in the twilight, stands my escape route. I am on the verge of collapse; my legs"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "giving out, my arms torn by the Breed and scorched by the red-hot casing of the"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "gun dangling limply by my side. But I am alive."
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "I drag myself to the accelleration couch and painfully strap myself in."
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Everything seems to be moving in slow motion; the cockpit spins sickeningly"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "around me as I reach for the launch controls.... there! I let myself fall back,"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "utterly exhausted. The quiet tones of the shipboard computer announces the"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "countdown, but for me the words are fading as if into a great distance."
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Something makes a dull thudding sound against the hull; the engines starting?"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "No, they cut in a moment later with a muted roar. The computer chatters to"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "itself and flashes coloured lights at me; I must have left the airlock open. No"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "matter. The computer will close it automatically before liftoff. I can stay"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "awake no longer. All I can think as I sink into unconsciousness is that I'm"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "feeling very... very... heavy..."
    }
  ],
