    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "THE CAST:"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Arnold the Alien"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Initially enthusiastic about his role, Arnold was mildly put out at being the"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "only unarmed combatant, and hence his vain attempts to sidle out of the line of"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "fire. Arnold was also somewhat dismayed by the stylish, fashion conscious, but"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "distressingly prominent shade of bright red his contract demanded he wear."
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Melvin the Mutant"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Melvin showed off his acting ability to the full in this, his latest appearance,"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "in which he played no fewer than three roles simultaneously: a pistol-wielding"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "psychotic soldier, a plasma-gun wielding psychotic soldier, and a shotgun"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "wielding psychotic soldier. He brushes aside claims that the difference between"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "the roles was purely cosmetic, saying that each required a completely different"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "mind-set, and regards it as his most challenging role to date."
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Frank the Floating Thing"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Another versatile actor, Frank spent a lot of time getting into his role, force-"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "feeding himself tons of weight gain pills and full-fat milkshakes so as to gain"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "personal experience of the lifestyle of the huge blubbery floating mound he"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "portrays. Now that's commitment for you!"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Worm Dude"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Teased at a tender age for his delicate pastel colouring, Worm grew up into the"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "bad boy of the Hollywood jetset. It is rumoured that he sawed off both his arms"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "and replaced them with powerful energy weapons in an attempt to upstage the"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "other members of the cast. After his success in AB3D, he says it is 'doubtful'"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "that he will return to his previous employment, serving in a fast food"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "establishment."
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Theresa Tentacle"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Theresa has the honour of wearing the most make-up of any cast member in this"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "production, or any other production for that matter. Terrence was fitted with a"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "a complete alien suit which moved around in response to her wrigglings. She"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "remarks that the hours spent getting in and out of the suit were 'worth it'."
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "She is confident that her role in AB3D will get her noticed by other"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "entertainment companies, and that this will be only the first of many openings"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "for her."
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Eric the Eyeball"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Eric was thrilled to discover he would be actually flying in his new role. He"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "says it is something he has always wanted to try, particularly if he could spit"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "fire at the same time. When the offer came up, he rolled at it straight away."
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Robbie the Robot"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Big, ugly, aggressive and none too bright, that's Robbie all over."
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 2,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Rupert the Really REALLY Big Thing on the Last Level"
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Rupert was delighted to finally find a role which he fit comfortably. Previous"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "attempts to integrate him into the cast of films has, inevitably perhaps,"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "involved enormous trenches, improbably high stacks of boxes or, in extreme cases"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "amputation of the lower body in order to bring him down to the level of other"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "actors."
    },
    {
      "font": -1,
      "centred": false,
      "text": ""
