    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "Thanks to all those who bought this game; presumably you enjoyed it enough to"
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "bother finishing it. A lot of work went into it, probably more than you think."
    },
    {
      "font": 0,
      "centred": true,
      "text": "It took a very long time to get just right. I hope you think it was worth the"
